 "text": "Hi, how have you been? I usually sit on the seat with one hand and the bags on the floor next to the gear with the other hand. A basket on the front or handlebars is the easiest option, but not all bikes have a proper one. Then I' suggest getting a handlebar bag. They' pretty reliable and you can wear one on rough trails. They' heavy and bulky, and you can't get your arms around them. bags you carry on the bike are much quicker to deal with.",
